Total females: <output value=" /data/sec3_taxa/all_females "/> | Total males: <output value=" /data/sec3_taxa/all_males "/> | **Total mosquitoes: <output value=" /data/sec3_taxa/all_total "/>**

Tubes packed: <output value=" /data/sec3_taxa/all_tubes "/> | Discarded: <output value=" /data/sec3_taxa/all_discarded "/> </label></input></group><group ref="/data/sec4_packaging"><label>Section 4: Sample packaging, dissection &amp; storage</label><input ref="/data/sec4_packaging/q08_non_target"><label>Q08. Non-target insect count</label><hint>Number of non-target insects (moths, beetles, non-culicids) sorted &amp; discarded</hint></input><select1 ref="/data/sec4_packaging/q09_dissection"><label>Q09. Anopheles for fresh dissection</label><itemset nodeset="instance('fresh_dissection')/root/item"><value ref="name"/><label ref="label"/></itemset></select1><input ref="/data/sec4_packaging/q09_dissection_qty"><label>Q09. Quantity transferred to SPEC-DIS</label></input><input ref="/data/sec4_packaging/num_packing"><label>Number of packing records (Q10-Q13)</label></input></group><group ref="/data/packing"><label>Packing record</label><repeat nodeset="/data/packing" jr:count=" /data/sec4_packaging/num_packing "><group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/packing/packing_info"><label> Packing record <output value=" ../packing_number "/> </label><select1 ref="/data/packing/packing_info/q10_packing_type"><label>Q10. Packing type</label><itemset nodeset="instance('packing_type')/root/item"><value ref="name"/><label ref="label"/></itemset></select1><input ref="/data/packing/packing_info/q11_box_barcode"><label>Q11. Storage box / plate barcode</label><hint>Format: Country + Node + Plate/Box number (SOP 2.4, e.g. TZDS 0001)</hint></input><input ref="/data/packing/packing_info/q12_position_from"><label>Q12. First well / tube position</label></input><input ref="/data/packing/packing_info/q12_position_to"><label>Q12. Last well / tube position</label></input><input ref="/data/packing/packing_info/q13_register_id"><label>Q13. Specimen register / plate map ID</label><hint>Link to the record listing specimen or pool IDs, positions and actual storage medium.</hint></input></group></repeat